// KitKat UI P16 Tier 1 (final): the Android 4.4 DeskClock ported per the
// Launcher3-Modern pattern - donor UI verbatim from android-4.4.4_r1
// (packages/apps/DeskClock + frameworks/opt/datetimepicker vendored
// in-tree as com.android.deskclock.viewpager / com.android.datetimepicker),
// modernized only where the build/API layer requires:
//  - support-v4/v13 ViewPager/PagerAdapter vendored with the compat layer
//    collapsed onto framework APIs (EdgeEffectCompat kept locally);
//    androidx ExploreByTouchHelper for datetimepicker accessibility;
//    SparseArrayCompat -> android.util.SparseArray.
//  - targetSdk 29 (pre-30 on purpose, same reasoning as Music).
//  - SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM manifest permission (API 31+; alarm schedule
//    shim is app-side handled by the donor AlarmManager paths +
//    AlarmClockManager intents, unchanged).
//  - exported=true on intent-filter components (API 31+ manifest rule).
//  - Application theme KitKatDeskClockTheme = donor Theme.Holo choice.
// Module keeps the name DeskClock so PRODUCT_PACKAGES resolves unchanged.
android_app {
    name: "DeskClock",
    product_specific: true,
    min_sdk_version: "21",
    sdk_version: "29",
    srcs: [
        "src/**/*.java",
    ],
    resource_dirs: [
        "res",
    ],
    static_libs: [
        
    ],
    optimize: {
        proguard_flags_files: ["proguard.flags"],
    },
    overrides: ["AlarmClock"],
}